:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[SV-001 (Super Rare Cat)]].''
'''SV-001''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = SV-001
|image = E 193.png
|appearance = [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2,370¢
}}

==Enemy==
SV-001 is a tank like unit, there to prevent you from hitting the boss. It has incredible speed and packs remarkable range. However, its attack power is a mere 400 damage. The 7,500 health will be a roadblock for new players, but cats such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] can effortlessly extinguish SV-001. While SV-001 can easily interrupt your advance, it cannot hold the line for long or do anything more than hurt a meatshield.

